<overview>
<p>The Word of Blake Militia inherited ComStar's combined-arms organizational philosophy and its Star League-era equipment stocks, fielding infantry formations that ranked among the best equipped in the Inner Sphere during the Jihad. Crewing ultra-light autocannon capable of double-rate fire, these gunners can pour out suppressive fire at ranges that keep them beyond effective return from most infantry weapons, though the rapid cycling risks jamming under sustained use.</p>
</overview>

<notes>
Squad/platoon size from TechManual. Armor kit from Tactical Operations. Intro date from official creation of ComStar Guards and Militia (ComGuards).
